cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Analysis code for a multivariable logistic regression of good functional outcome in convalescent rehabilitation inpatients (RCS + smcfcs)"
abstract: >-
  R code implementing preprocessing, substantive-model-compatible multiple
  imputation (smcfcs), restricted cubic spline modelling, separation handling,
  variable and interaction selection, performance assessment and
  internal-external cross-validation for a multivariable logistic regression of
  good functional outcome in convalescent rehabilitation inpatients. No
  individual patient data are included.
type: software
